  "description": "The certified fragment library for Fuaran UI — a curated set of parameterised FragmentDecls (typed holes over bounded value-spaces, declared two-axis effect classes, wire round-trip fixtures in the shared conformance corpus) for the composite shapes consumer apps keep re-deriving: a labelled metric row, a KPI strip, a filter bar, a confirm/cancel pair, an empty-state panel, a section header, a metric card, a loading placeholder. Every fragment is certified valid-for-all-bindings by the recipe-certification floor before it ships. APPLICATION-SPACE composition: fragments are reusable composition for consumer apps, content packs and pattern banks — they are not a second language vocabulary and never gate or substitute for NodeKind admission. FSharp.Core + Fuaran.UI only (Fable-clean; no renderer, ops or host dependency). Apache-2.0 licensed.",
